油脂和醬汁和飽滿分明的好吃米飯讓手裡的湯匙和嘴巴停不下來享受。吃完的意猶未盡，只好藉由追加麵的到來，重回拉麵來彌補口腹。\n\n絕對還要再訪，試試其他口味，但也想要繼續品嚐吃過的好吃餐點，實在兩難。",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8054786247900985761/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVFdOdGRGVlRWVkpKWTFWWk0yRldWVE5YVjJ4VFZHMVJlV1JWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8054786247900985761/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVFdOdGRGVlRWVkpKWTFWWk0yRldWVE5YVjJ4VFZHMVJlV1JWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8054786247900985761/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVFdOdGRGVlRWVkpKWTFWWk0yRldWVE5YVjJ4VFZHMVJlV1JWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8054786247900985761/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVFdOdGRGVlRWVkpKWTFWWk0yRldWVE5YVjJ4VFZHMVJlV1JWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8054786247900985761/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVFdOdGRGVlRWVkpKWTFWWk0yRldWVE5YVjJ4VFZHMVJlV1JWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8054786247900985761/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVFdOdGRGVlRWVkpKWTFWWk0yRldWVE5YVjJ4VFZHMVJlV1JWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7603,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTWNtdFVTVVJJY1VZM2FWVTNXV2xTVG1ReWRVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x9b6020f2f9dec713!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnFMcmtUSURIcUY3aVU3WWlSTmQydUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTWNtdFVTVVJJY1VZM2FWVTNXV2xTVG1ReWRVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTWNtdFVTVVJJY1VZM2FWVTNXV2xTVG1ReWRVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTWNtdFVTVVJJY1VZM2FWVTNXV2xTVG1ReWRVRRILMGNxZjlfYXdUOUIaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uRk1jbXRVU1VSSWNVWTNhVlUzV1dsU1RtUXlkVUUSCzBjcWY5X2F3VDlCIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARE8fe-fIgYJsqCzBjcWY5X2F3VDlC\u0026